# Lest We Forget (WotG 54) at Status 1 (A Token of Troth's finish sets it), in Grauberg [S]. afterZoneIn at Status 1
# sets nothing. The Veridical Conflux plays 39 [89, 23, 1756]; the update with option 131074 (selections 1 and 1) sends
# 05C [404161282, 59] ((3 << 27) + (23 << 16) + 770, (0 << 11) + 59); the finish with that option adds the Moonshade
# Earring (item 11697: the trace's row has an empty extra, since the positional addItem takes no augments), says
# ITEM_OBTAINED (6395) and clears Status. After a rezone, the earring held, afterZoneIn sets nothing: the qm_reset
# answers with Grauberg [S]'s DefaultActions AIR_WARPED_AND_DISTORTED (8413), and the Veridical Conflux at Status 0 with
# MYSTERIOUS_COLUMN_ROTATES (8387).
lists GraubergS/Veridical_Conflux/onTrigger GraubergS/qm_reset/onTrigger GraubergS/afterZoneIn/1 GraubergS/onEventUpdate/39 GraubergS/onEventFinish/39 GraubergS/onEventFinish/46
char zone=GraubergS pos=-140.28,-6.749,585.24 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg LestWeForget current
charvar Mission[5][53]Status 1
login
tick 5000                                  # afterZoneIn: Status 1, nothing
trigger Veridical_Conflux                  # 39
update 39 option=131074                    # selections 1 and 1: the augment parameters
finish option=131074                       # the earring: ACC+4, Regain +10; Status 0
rezone
tick 5000                                  # the earring held: nothing
trigger qm_reset                           # Option 0: nothing
finish-if-event
trigger Veridical_Conflux                  # Status 0: nothing
finish-if-event
